 summary:["Leptospirosis = L. interrogans; reservoir = ไตหนู","Septicemic phase ~1 wk: fever, calf/back myalgia, conjunctival suffusion","Immune phase: Weil's (jaundice + AKI + bleeding), aseptic meningitis","Dx: MAT 4-fold rise (หรือ PCR ระยะแรก)","Rx: severe → Pen G IV/ceftriaxone; mild → doxycycline"],
